award was significantly reconfigured, and is now given annually to a single book in English translation, with a £50,000 prize for the winning title, shared equally between author and translator. The award has been known as the International Booker Prize since the Man Group ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d52\"},\"ref\":\"d52\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Moor's Account,\\\" was a contender for both the Man Booker Prize and the Pulitzer Prize; Chris Bachelder, whose most recent book, \\\"The Throwback Special,\\\" was a finalist for the 2016 National Book Award for Fiction; Min Jin Lee, whose novel \\\"Pachinko\\\" was a finalist for the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.newyorker.com/books/page-turner/the-2018-national-book-awards-longlist-fiction\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Future is the translation of Leroux's French-language novel L'Avenir.\\n\\nLeroux is a writer, translator and journalist from Montreal. She was shortlisted for the 2016 Scotiabank Giller Prize for The Party Wall, which is an English translation of her French-language short story collection Le ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/the-top-20-canadian-books-of-2024-so-far-1.7252475\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d54\"},\"ref\":\"d54\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2018, the Polish novelist was recognized for \\\"Flights,\\\" which she calls a \\\"constellation novel,\\\" owing to its fragmentary form and genre-defying style, and which won that year's Man Booker Prize. \\\"Drive Your Plow Over the Bones of the Dead,\\\" her latest novel to be translated ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.newyorker.com/books/page-turner/the-2019-national-book-awards-longlist-translated-literature\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... In London, Geetanjali Shree and Daisy Rockwell Win the 2022 International Booker Prize\\nauthor: Porter Anderson\\ndate: 2022-05-26\\n---\\n'Tomb of Sand' is the first novel translated from an Indian language to win the award. Shree and Rockwell split the International Booker's £50,000 purse.\\n\\nBy ... \",\"title\":\"https://publishingperspectives.com/2022/05/geetanjali-shree-and-daisy-rockwell-win-the-international-booker-prize/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... were both finalists for the Booker prize. His novels have been translated into more than 29 languages and won the inaugural FT/Oppenheimer Award for Fiction, an NAACP Image Award, the LA Times Book prize, the Internationaler literaturpreis and was nominated for many other awards. The Fishermen was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.oxbelly.com/fiction-writers-program/advisors\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... The international award had a separate prize for translation. Since 2016, the international prize has been focusing on fiction for translation with the winning author and translator getting 50,000 British Pounds.\\n\\nThe Pulitzer Prize\\n\\nThe man credited with the establishment of the Pulitzer Prizes was Joseph Pulitzer ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.worldatlas.com/articles/the-most-prestigious-literary-awards-in-the-world.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"025f157c32754239bdb6fb1db93dca173788ff56743feaa467029c160eef3714\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"5d01f7a8b9458c76bf8819476ec17d0a47eb4245e0920627af567db6b42a5c09\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"2016 novel contender Man Booker International Prize translated many languages\",\"view\":\"full\"}],\"search_raw\":{\"attempt_limit\":6,\"attempts_used\":3,\"document\":\"d5\",\"selection\":{\"block_truncated\":false,\"end\":26993,\"instruction\":\"Check the subject and adjoining context; lexical overlap does not establish the requested relation.\",\"matched\":true,\"matched_terms\":[\"man\",\"booker\",\"international\",\"prize\",\"2016\"],\"method\":\"paragraph-lexical-v1\",\"score\":8.36336,\"selected_block\":[24337,25007],\"selection_is_semantic_support\":false,\"start\":23993},\"status\":\"success\",\"version\":\"search-raw-window-v1\"}}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_469a0a04b2044733a0292a7d"},{"content":"I have a strong lead. Let me reconsider the puzzle structure:\n\n- Award created in 2000s: Man Booker International Prize (created 2005) ✓\n- Book B: The Vegetarian by Han Kang, won the prize in 2016, released in English in 2015 (preceding year) ✓\n- Book A: published in 2016, contender for the same prize, translated into 25+ languages\n- Author of Book B (Han Kang) born in the city where Author of Book A grew up\n\nHan Kang was born in Gwangju, South Korea. So I need to find a 2016 book that was a contender for the Man Booker International Prize, translated into 25+ languages, whose author grew up in Gwangju.\n\nLet me search for the 2016 Man Booker International Prize shortlist and books translated into 25+ languages.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Booker International Prize 2016 shortlist six books\", \"2016 International Booker Prize shortlist nominees list\", \"Man Booker International 2016 shortlisted books authors\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_093481557aaa49db855b8e3a","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"raw_windows\":[],\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":26993,\"ref\":\"e3\",\"start\":23993}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2016, the award was significantly reconfigured, and is now given annually to a single book in English translation, with a £50,000 prize for the winning title, shared equally between author and translator. The award has been known as the International Booker Prize since the Man Group ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her work has won the Nobel Prize in Literature, two Scotiabank Giller Prizes, three Governor General's Literary Awards and the Man Booker International Prize. Her first book, Dance of the Happy Shades, was released in 1968, and she continued to write stories until retiring in 2013.\\n\\nWachtel ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... In a news conference earlier today, International Booker Prize jury chair Frank Wynne credited independent publishers with the lion's share of translated work. \\\"Nobody is surprised that the majority of books on the long- and shortlist,\\\" he said, \\\"are independent publishers. Small independent pres